[00:00.00] 作曲 : David Gilmour/Richard Wright
[00:00.00][by:Aoiddd]
[01:30.49]Speech has allowed the communication of ideas, enabling human beings to work together, to build the impossible.
[01:30.49]语言使得人们可以交流自己的想法，令人们能够一同工作，并以此创造奇迹
[01:41.49]Mankind’s greatest achievements have come about by talking...
[01:41.49]人类最伟大的成就正是在”交流“中逐渐成形
[01:53.49]Our greatest hopes could become reality in the future. With the technology at our disposal, the possibilities are unbounded.
[01:53.49]即便是我们最狂妄的愿景也可能在未来实现,在我们现有的科技条件下，未来有着无限量的可能性
[02:28.49]All we need to do is make sure we keep talking.
[02:28.49]而我们所需要去做的，就是确保我们能够一直以语言交流
